{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>35歲的前港姐冠軍陳凱琳與丈夫鄭嘉穎婚後育有三子，一直被外界視為人生勝利組。日前她於香港街頭接受外國KOL隨機訪問時，竟然大爆對婚姻生活留有「遺憾」，引起熱議。</p>\n<h2>陳凱琳受訪激讚港男極具紳士風度</h2>\n<p>打扮高貴性感的陳凱琳日前在香港街頭被外國KOL隨機截停進行訪問，期間被問及對香港男生的真實評價。她毫不猶疑地向主持人極力推薦香港男生，大讚本地男士非常懂得照顧身邊伴侶。她在鏡頭前直言港男普遍擁有一種「一定要照顧女生」的體貼心態，更極力慫恿從未與港男約會過的外國主持人務必親身嘗試。</p>\n<h2>罕談丈夫鄭嘉穎自爆早婚留有遺憾</h2>\n<p>陳凱琳在2018年8月結婚，同年11月宣佈懷孕，她提起丈夫鄭嘉穎，透露對方從小在美國讀書，性格與思想屬中西合璧，直言「他不是那種完全的香港男生」。隨後她突然自爆當年僅27歲便步入婚姻殿堂，坦言現時只能看著身邊朋友拍拖「過乾癮」。當主持人追問29歲結婚是否合適時，陳凱琳隨即給予勸告，直指如果對方等到36歲才結婚，認為這樣可以多享受6年單身約會樂趣。</p>\n<h2>網民：估唔到人生勝利組都會後悔</h2>\n<p>有網民對於她勸退主持人的舉動感到震驚，留言表示「估唔到人生勝利組都會後悔結得早」、「睇得出佢真係好懷念拍拖自由自在日子」。同時亦有大批網民將焦點放在其真實反應上，紛紛指出「佢勸人遲婚嗰陣笑得好真」、「嘉穎聽到老婆想玩多6年唔知有咩反應」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17938074034891244_16937277836aeb542bd2500.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17938074034891244_16937277836aeb542bd2500.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>35歲的前港姐冠軍陳凱琳與丈夫鄭嘉穎婚後育有三子，一直被外界視為人生勝利組。（圖片來源：陳凱琳IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380740573733236_18438618766aeb542e0527b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380740573733236_18438618766aeb542e0527b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>她提起丈夫鄭嘉穎，透露對方從小在美國讀書，性格與思想屬中西合璧，直言「他不是那種完全的香港男生」。（圖片來源：IG@christinacasss）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380740717583824_6057668876aeb542f6eb0e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380740717583824_6057668876aeb542f6eb0e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>日前她於香港街頭接受外國KOL隨機訪問時，竟然大爆對婚姻生活留有「遺憾」，引起熱議。（圖片來源：IG@christinacasss）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380740897296333_21366857696aeb543134d3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380740897296333_21366857696aeb543134d3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>隨後她突然自爆當年僅27歲便步入婚姻殿堂，坦言現時只能看著身邊朋友拍拖「過乾癮」。（圖片來源：IG@christinacasss）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380741050452994_8125501136aeb5432c0f71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179380741050452994_8125501136aeb5432c0f71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳凱琳隨即給予勸告，直指如果對方等到36歲才結婚，認為這樣可以多享受6年單身約會樂趣。（圖片來源：IG@christinacasss）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:49.738721+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1104,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:50:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:39.615568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:50.433144+00:00","content_hash":"7e0ebfece63f2b1037122a72e8021fb315db57beed409e997cc8d53e58dd1ebb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}